ation, borrowed from computer science and product durability design [Author et al., 2023](https://openalex.org/W4385617137), and adapted here to discover and validate interphases whose dynamic chloride redistribution stabilizes sodium-solid-electrolyte interfaces. The scientific advance is therefore not simply a new material stack, but a falsifiable mechanism and design loop for durable solid-state sodium storage.",
